MODULE: FIREBASE_SETUP

OBJECTIVE:
Define Firebase backend architecture for MINERVA.

SERVICES:
- FirebaseAuthentication
- Firestore
- FirebaseStorage
- CloudFunctions
- FirebaseHosting

COLLECTIONS:
- users
- profiles
- lessons
- questions
- attempts
- mastery
- missions
- officerTrials
- afterActionReviews
- generatedQuestionValidation

SECURITY:
- UsersCanReadOwnProgress
- UsersCanWriteOwnAttempts
- AdminsCanPublishCurriculum
- GeneratedQuestionsMustBeValidatedBeforePublic
